	"notice": "Connect the main adapter to the instrument MIDI OUT and its sub-adapter to MIDI IN. Power comes from the instrument MIDI OUT; there is no USB power input. Use WIDI App for pairing and group settings. This is a MIDI transport profile; connected instruments require their own profiles. No instrument control assignments are supplied. Exact browser port names are unverified; select this profile manually. Diagrams are simplified connection and control schematics, not scale drawings.",
